          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your own words, like “less on weekends”. You'll see the change before it applies." : {
      "comment" : "Explains changing the plan by talking to the buddy",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In deinen eigenen Worten, zum Beispiel „am Wochenende weniger“. Du siehst die Änderung, bevor sie übernommen wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Díselo con tus propias palabras, por ejemplo: «menos los fines de semana». Verás el cambio antes de que se aplique."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec tes mots, par exemple « moins le week-end ». Tu verras le changement avant qu’il soit appliqué."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com suas palavras, como “menos tempo nos fins de semana”. Você verá a mudança antes de ela ser aplicada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intermediate" : {
      "comment" : "A course level",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mittelstufe"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intermedio"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intermédiaire"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intermediário"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It leaves your goals and its plan stops. What you learned stays in your progress." : {
      "comment" : "Explains what archiving a goal does",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Ziel wird aus deinen Zielen entfernt und sein Plan wird beendet. Was du gelernt hast, bleibt in deinem Fortschritt erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deja de aparecer entre tus objetivos y su plan se detiene. Lo que has aprendido se mantiene en tu progreso."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cet objectif quitte ta liste et son plan s’arrête. Ce que tu as appris reste dans ta progression."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A meta sai da sua lista e o plano dela para. O que você aprendeu continua no seu progresso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It usually takes a minute or two. Your plan opens here as soon as it's ready." : {
      "comment" : "Explains that the plan appears on its own once it's built",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das dauert normalerweise ein bis zwei Minuten. Dein Plan öffnet sich hier, sobald er fertig ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suele tardar uno o dos minutos. Tu plan aparecerá aquí en cuanto esté listo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela prend généralement une ou deux minutes. Ton plan s’ouvrira ici dès qu’il sera prêt."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geralmente leva um ou dois minutos. Seu plano aparece aqui assim que estiver pronto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's in your plan from your next study day. Today's session stays as it is." : {
      "comment" : "Says a change starts on the next study day",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
